<title>USA: Stewart Enterprises added to Nasdaq 100.</title>
<headline>Stewart Enterprises added to Nasdaq 100.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stewart Enterprises Inc said Thursday that it will join the Nasdaq-100 Index, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The Index includes 100 of the largest nonfinancial domestic companies listed on the national market tier of the Nasdaq Stock Market and reflects its largest-growth companies across major industry groups.</p>
<p>Stewart Enterprises owns and operates 368 funeral homes and 127 cemeteries in 23 states, Puerto Rico, Mexico, Australia, New Zealand, Canada and Spain.</p>
